     "<div>Hi Everyone!</div><div><br></div><div>The DataLab has made Tea Time and DataLab Co-Working a permanent (as much as anything is) part of our activities. They are even still at the same place and time! If you forgot though they are in the same place as D-RUG (DataLab Classroom, Library 360). Tea Time runs from 1-2pm and Co-Working runs from 2-4pm. The official blurbs and calendar links are below:<br></div><div><div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>Take a break from your work physically and mentally with Tea Time\r\n at the DataLab. Join us for tea (or coffee) and cookies. Connect and \r\nsocialize with other people in the data science community. We will meet \r\nevery Thursday during the Fall Quarter from 1-2pm in the DataLab \r\nClassroom (<a href=\"https://library.ucdavis.edu/floor-maps/?floor=3\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://library.ucdavis.edu/floor-maps/?floor%3D3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32qzpkywKB4nb6zZvo4cVZ\">Library 360</a>). This is not Office Hours or a place to get help, but rather a way to take a break from whatever problem you are working on.</p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&amp;dates=20240926T130000/20240926T140000&amp;text=Tea%20Time&amp;details=Take+a+break+from+your+work+physically+and+mentally+with+Tea+Time+at+the+DataLab.+Join+us+for+tea+%28or+coffee%29+and+cookies.+Connect+and+socialize+with+other+people+in+the+data+science+community.+We+will+meet+every+Thursday+during+the+Fall+Quarter+from+1-2pm+in+the+DataLab+Classroom+%28%3Ca+href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Flibrary.ucdavis.edu%2Ffloor-maps%2F%3Ffloor%3D3%22+rel%3D%22nofollow%22%3ELibrary+360%3C%2Fa%3E%29.+This+is+not+Office+Hours+or+a+place+to+get+help%2C+but+rather+a+way+to+take+a+break+from+whatever+problem+you+are+working+on.&amp;location=DataLab%20Classroom%20–%20Shields%20360,%20Shields%20Library,%203rd%20floor,%20100%20NW%20Quad,%20Davis,%20CA,%2095616,%20United%20States&amp;trp=false&amp;ctz=America/Los_Angeles&amp;sprop=website:https://datalab.ucdavis.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noindex nofollow\" title=\"Add to Google Calendar\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action%3DTEMPLATE%26dates%3D20240926T130000/20240926T140000%26text%3DTea%2520Time%26details%3DTake%2Ba%2Bbreak%2Bfrom%2Byour%2Bwork%2Bphysically%2Band%2Bmentally%2Bwith%2BTea%2BTime%2Bat%2Bthe%2BDataLab.%2BJoin%2Bus%2Bfor%2Btea%2B%2528or%2Bcoffee%2529%2Band%2Bcookies.%2BConnect%2Band%2Bsocialize%2Bwith%2Bother%2Bpeople%2Bin%2Bthe%2Bdata%2Bscience%2Bcommunity.%2BWe%2Bwill%2Bmeet%2Bevery%2BThursday%2Bduring%2Bthe%2BFall%2BQuarter%2Bfrom%2B1-2pm%2Bin%2Bthe%2BDataLab%2BClassroom%2B%2528%253Ca%2Bhref%253D%2522https%253A%252F%252Flibrary.ucdavis.edu%252Ffloor-maps%252F%253Ffloor%253D3%2522%2Brel%253D%2522nofollow%2522%253ELibrary%2B360%253C%252Fa%253E%2529.%2BThis%2Bis%2Bnot%2BOffice%2BHours%2Bor%2Ba%2Bplace%2Bto%2Bget%2Bhelp%252C%2Bbut%2Brather%2Ba%2Bway%2Bto%2Btake%2Ba%2Bbreak%2Bfrom%2Bwhatever%2Bproblem%2Byou%2Bare%2Bworking%2Bon.%26location%3DDataLab%2520Classroom%2520%E2%80%93%2520Shields%2520360,%2520Shields%2520Library,%25203rd%2520floor,%2520100%2520NW%2520Quad,%2520Davis,%2520CA,%252095616,%2520United%2520States%26trp%3Dfalse%26ctz%3DAmerica/Los_Angeles%26sprop%3Dwebsite:https://datalab.ucdavis.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EzuIapxQgYNuISNOX7NIO\">+ Google Calendar</a><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/tea-time/?ical=1\" title=\"Download .ics file\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noindex nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/tea-time/?ical%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1d4OVlhkWG6R_OmssU0JtZ\">+ Add to iCalendar</a></div><div><br></div><div><div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>Miss human interaction but still need to get work done? Hit a \r\nroad block and need a change of scenery to change your thought \r\nprocesses. Shake up your normal work schedule with Co-Working at the \r\nDataLab! We will meet every Thursday during the Fall Quarter from 2-4pm \r\nin the DataLab Classroom (<a href=\"https://library.ucdavis.edu/floor-maps/?floor=3\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://library.ucdavis.edu/floor-maps/?floor%3D3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32qzpkywKB4nb6zZvo4cVZ\">Library 360</a>).\r\n This is not Office Hours or a place to get help, but rather a way to be\r\n in community with others while still getting work done.</p>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&amp;dates=20240926T140000/20240926T160000&amp;text=DataLab%20Co-Working&amp;details=Miss+human+interaction+but+still+need+to+get+work+done%3F+Hit+a+road+block+and+need+a+change+of+scenery+to+change+your+thought+processes.+Shake+up+your+normal+work+schedule+with+Co-Working+at+the+DataLab%21+We+will+meet+every+Thursday+during+the+Fall+Quarter+from+2-4pm+in+the+DataLab+Classroom+%28%3Ca+href%3D%22https%3A%2F%2Flibrary.ucdavis.edu%2Ffloor-maps%2F%3Ffloor%3D3%22+rel%3D%22nofollow%22%3ELibrary+360%3C%2Fa%3E%29.+This+is+not+Office+Hours+or+a+place+to+get+help%2C+but+rather+a+way+to+be+in+community+with+others+while+still+getting+work+done.&amp;location=DataLab%20Classroom%20–%20Shields%20360,%20Shields%20Library,%203rd%20floor,%20100%20NW%20Quad,%20Davis,%20CA,%2095616,%20United%20States&amp;trp=false&amp;ctz=America/Los_Angeles&amp;sprop=website:https://datalab.ucdavis.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noindex nofollow\" title=\"Add to Google Calendar\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action%3DTEMPLATE%26dates%3D20240926T140000/20240926T160000%26text%3DDataLab%2520Co-Working%26details%3DMiss%2Bhuman%2Binteraction%2Bbut%2Bstill%2Bneed%2Bto%2Bget%2Bwork%2Bdone%253F%2BHit%2Ba%2Broad%2Bblock%2Band%2Bneed%2Ba%2Bchange%2Bof%2Bscenery%2Bto%2Bchange%2Byour%2Bthought%2Bprocesses.%2BShake%2Bup%2Byour%2Bnormal%2Bwork%2Bschedule%2Bwith%2BCo-Working%2Bat%2Bthe%2BDataLab%2521%2BWe%2Bwill%2Bmeet%2Bevery%2BThursday%2Bduring%2Bthe%2BFall%2BQuarter%2Bfrom%2B2-4pm%2Bin%2Bthe%2BDataLab%2BClassroom%2B%2528%253Ca%2Bhref%253D%2522https%253A%252F%252Flibrary.ucdavis.edu%252Ffloor-maps%252F%253Ffloor%253D3%2522%2Brel%253D%2522nofollow%2522%253ELibrary%2B360%253C%252Fa%253E%2529.%2BThis%2Bis%2Bnot%2BOffice%2BHours%2Bor%2Ba%2Bplace%2Bto%2Bget%2Bhelp%252C%2Bbut%2Brather%2Ba%2Bway%2Bto%2Bbe%2Bin%2Bcommunity%2Bwith%2Bothers%2Bwhile%2Bstill%2Bgetting%2Bwork%2Bdone.%26location%3DDataLab%2520Classroom%2520%E2%80%93%2520Shields%2520360,%2520Shields%2520Library,%25203rd%2520floor,%2520100%2520NW%2520Quad,%2520Davis,%2520CA,%252095616,%2520United%2520States%26trp%3Dfalse%26ctz%3DAmerica/Los_Angeles%26sprop%3Dwebsite:https://datalab.ucdavis.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0e68G_O4DaBTGJKCsqwmxq\">+ Google Calendar</a><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/datalab-co-working/?ical=1\" title=\"Download .ics file\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noindex nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/eventscalendar/datalab-co-working/?ical%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464548007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24dWMKuVbYTs8XLrfkFR4w\">+ Add to iCalendar</a></div></div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,</div><div>Your CooRdinators<br></div></div>"
